	(44, '719cd5d2-9ef8-4fd1-ac01-da68346ad86f', 'SPOT', 3, 'description', '신들의 섬이라 불리는 발리. 아름다운 해변, 울창한 정글, 독특한 힌두 문화가 가득하다', '08af13e4fe5958630dcbffee755a3f865b94a3f62433b98016d3833a1a15b9e7', 'en', 'Bali, known as the Island of the Gods. It is filled with beautiful beaches, lush jungles, and unique Hindu culture.', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-16 07:40:58', '2026-04-16 07:40:58'),
