	(463, '3191280d-c0a8-475a-adf4-3d974fc83a5e', 'COMMUNITY_POST', 62, 'content', '프랑스령 작은 섬나라. 시드니에서 3시간, 한국에선 인천발 직항 가끔 뜹니다. 아메데 등대섬 투명 바다는 제가 본 것 중 최고. 프랑스 빵과 남태평양 해산물 조합이 별미입니다.', '67a464ecd67283b9b648e3f71d99d9f341d8b6df1db450b7143b610064e3e7df', 'en', 'A small French island nation. It takes 3 hours from Sydney, and direct flights from Incheon, Korea occasionally operate. The crystal-clear waters around Amédée Lighthouse are the best I have ever seen. The combination of French bread and South Pacific seafood is a delicacy.', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-21 07:40:22', '2026-04-21 07:40:22'),
	(464, 'e699fcfb-bc1a-409c-bef9-2f23d87b02a3', 'COMMUNITY_POST', 39, 'title', 'PERSPECTIVE API 실험입니다. 양해부탁드립니다. (씨발 오늘 진짜 짜증나네. 씨발 씨발 씨발)', '46d499a5dbab272e94b2f20dd907a8626578827586dd449bf2883863fd151478', 'en', 'This is a PERSPECTIVE API experiment. We ask for your understanding. (Fuck, today is seriously annoying. Fuck fuck fuck)', 'google-cloud-translation-v2', '2026-04-21 07:40:23', '2026-04-21 07:40:23'),
